#X text 240 83 The object converts a phase value given in the range
[0 \, 1] to the corresponding angle in radians \, in the range [0 \,
2π]. A phase of 0 maps to 0 radians \, a phase of 0.5 maps to π radians
\, and a phase of 1 maps to 2π radians. This is the inverse operation
of [conv.rad2phase].;
